            "explanationHinglish": "Bachke rehna (\"Brine ke electrolysis se sodium dhatu banta hai.\"): Cathode par Na⁺ aur H⁺ dono hain. Topic 3 ke order mein H⁺ pehle chunta hai: 2H⁺ + 2e⁻ → H₂. Agar kisi tarah Na bana bhi, to wo turant paani se react karke NaOH aur H₂ de deta (2Na + 2H₂O → 2NaOH + H₂; Na 2 = 2, H 4 = 4, O 2 = 2 ✅). Isliye sodium dhatu brine se nahi, pighle NaCl se milta hai (Metallurgy Part 4)."
