            "heading": "Key Vocabulary",
            "headingHinglish": "Naye shabd",
            "body": "| Term | Meaning | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Gay-Lussac's Law of Combining Volumes** | Measured at the same temperature and pressure, the volumes of reacting gases and gaseous products stand in a ratio of small whole numbers | H₂ : Cl₂ : HCl = 1 : 1 : 2 |\n| **Avogadro's Law** | Equal volumes of all gases at the same temperature and pressure contain equal numbers of molecules | 1 L of H₂ and 1 L of O₂ have the same number of molecules |\n| **Molecule** | The smallest group of one or more atoms that moves independently as a single particle in a gas | H₂ (2 atoms), He (1 atom) |\n| **Atomicity** | The number of atoms in a single molecule of an element | Atomicity of O₂ is 2 |\n| **Monoatomic** | A molecule made of a single atom | He, Ne, Ar |\n| **Diatomic** | A molecule made of two atoms | H₂, O₂, N₂, Cl₂ |\n| **Triatomic** | A molecule made of three atoms | O₃ (ozone) |\n| **Polyatomic** | A molecule made of more than three atoms | P₄, S₈ |\n| **Steam** | The gaseous state of water (at or above roughly 100 °C) | 2H₂ + O₂ → 2H₂O(g) |",
            "bodyHinglish": "| Shabd | Matlab (simple bhasha mein) | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Gay-Lussac ka combining volumes ka niyam** | Same taapman aur dabao par, reaction mein gaso ke volume aapas mein aur gas wale products ke saath chhoti poori sankhyaon ke ratio mein hote hain | H₂ : Cl₂ : HCl = 1 : 1 : 2 |\n| **Avogadro ka niyam** | Same taapman aur dabao par barabar volume ki sabhi gaso mein molecules ki sankhya barabar | 1 L H₂ aur 1 L O₂ mein molecule barabar |\n| **Molecule** | Ek ya zyada atom ka wo chhota se chhota samooh jo gas ke roop mein akela chalta hai | H₂ (2 atom), He (1 atom) |\n| **Atomicity** | Ek molecule mein atoms ki sankhya | O₂ ki atomicity 2 |\n| **Monoatomic** | Ek atom ka molecule | He, Ne, Ar |\n| **Diatomic** | Do atom ka molecule | H₂, O₂, N₂, Cl₂ |\n| **Triatomic** | Teen atom ka molecule | O₃ (ozone) |\n| **Polyatomic** | Teen se zyada atom ka molecule | P₄, S₈ |\n| **Steam** | Paani ka gas roop (lagbhag 100 °C ya upar) | 2H₂ + O₂ → 2H₂O(g) |"
