            "body": "Across this chapter we have added five big pieces to our bonding puzzle: unequal sharing and partial charges in Topic 1, molecular shape and polarity in Topic 2, coordinate bonds in Topic 3, three bond types inside a single compound in Topic 4, and the master comparison of bond types and properties in Topic 5. Today we pack all these tools into a single **toolbox**, sharpen our 4-step master method, and test it on a full round of mixed puzzles before wrapping up with a complete chapter summary.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Is chapter mein humne ek-ek karke chhe cheezein jodi: Topic 1 mein unequal sharing aur partial charges, Topic 2 mein molecule ka shape aur uski polarity, Topic 3 mein coordinate bond, Topic 4 mein ek hi compound ke andar teen kism ke bond, aur Topic 5 mein saare bonds ki tulna aur unke gun. Ab ye sab alag-alag auzaar hain. Aaj hum inhe ek **toolbox** mein rakhenge, ek 4-step method banayenge, aur phir naye-naye puzzles par aazmayenge. Aakhir mein poore chapter ka saar."
