            "body": "On Friday afternoon, Elena's school Science Club hosted a game called **\"Bond Bingo.\"** The club teacher invited Elena's uncle, Dr. Morales, to be the caller, and Elena received a 3 × 3 bingo card printed with nine chemical formulas.\n\n```\n   [ CaF₂ ]     [ H₂S ]      [ KI ]\n   [ PH₃ ]      [ MgCl₂ ]    [ HI ]\n   [ CS₂ ]      [ AlCl₃ ]    [ SiH₄ ]\n```\n\n> **Figure 6.1** – Elena's Bond Bingo card: nine formulas in nine squares. The caller reads a clue, and players mark the square that matches the clue.\n\nThere was one special house rule: a mark on a square counted **only if** the player could state the **chemical reason** behind it. Without a valid reason, the mark was wiped off! Elena looked at her card and sighed, \"Uncle Morales, memorizing facts for nine different formulas is impossible!\" Dr. Morales laughed. \"You don't need to memorize a single one. Everything you learned across the five topics boils down to **four quick questions**. Ask those four questions for every clue, and the right square on your card will practically mark itself.\"\n\nThen Dr. Morales called out the first clue: *\"A metal and a non-metal with an enormous difference in electronegativity.\"* Elena's pencil moved straight toward CaF₂. Now for the reason—let's build the exact method together.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Friday ko Mugdha ke school ke Science Club mein ek khel tha: **\"Bond Bingo\"**. Mugdha ke chacha, Mr. Mokashi, ko teacher ne caller banaya tha, aur Mugdha ko ek card mila jisme nau formulas the.\n\n```\n   [ CaF₂ ]     [ H₂S ]      [ KI ]\n   [ PH₃ ]      [ MgCl₂ ]    [ HI ]\n   [ CS₂ ]      [ AlCl₃ ]    [ SiH₄ ]\n```\n\n> **Figure 6.1** – Mugdha ka Bond Bingo card: nau formulas, nau cell. Caller ek clue padhta hai aur khiladi us cell par nishaan lagata hai jo clue se milta hai.\n\nKhel ka niyam alag tha: nishaan tabhi pakka, jab **kaaran** bhi bolo. Bina kaaran ke nishaan mita diya jaata. Mugdha ne kaha, \"Chacha, itne formulas, ratna to mushkil hai!\" Mr. Mokashi hanse. \"Ratna hai hi nahi. Chhe topics mein humne jo kuch sikha, use chaar sawaalon mein baandh lo. Har clue par wahi chaar sawaal poochho, aur jawab khud card par nishaan laga dega.\"\n\nMugdha ne pehla clue suna: \"Metal aur non-metal, farq bahut bada.\" Uska haath apne aap CaF₂ ki taraf gaya. Par kaaran? Wahi aaj hum banayenge."
