        "summary": "From Topic 1 to Topic 5 we built our analytical chemistry toolkit piece by piece: the NaOH tests in Topic 2, the NH₄OH tests and amphoteric behavior in Topic 3, the anion and ammonium tests in Topic 4, and the complete unknown-salt detective plan in Topic 5.",
        "summaryHinglish": "Topic 1 se Topic 5 tak humne ek-ek tool banaya: NaOH ka test (Topic 2), NH₄OH ka test (Topic 3), anion aur ammonium ke test (Topic 4), aur Topic 5 mein inhein jodkar anjaan namak ki pehchaan ki yojana.",
