            "heading": "Key Vocabulary",
            "headingHinglish": "Naye shabd",
            "body": "| Term | Meaning | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Tetravalency** | Having a valency of 4—capable of forming four covalent bonds | carbon forming 4 bonds in CH₄ |\n| **Catenation** | The ability of atoms of the same element to link with one another to form long chains, branched chains, or rings | carbon chains C–C–C–C |\n| **Organic compound** | A carbon-containing compound built primarily of carbon and hydrogen (often with O, N, Cl, Br, etc.) | sugar, gasoline, soap |\n| **Inorganic compound** | Compounds of all other elements, including metals, salts, mineral acids, and simple oxides | NaCl, H₂SO₄ |\n| **Allotropes** | Different structural forms of the same element in which the atoms are bonded in different arrangements | diamond, graphite, and C₆₀ |\n| **Crystalline** | Having atoms arranged in a regular, repeating three-dimensional lattice | diamond, graphite |\n| **Amorphous** | Lacking a regular long-range repeating arrangement of atoms | coal, charcoal, lamp-black |\n| **Fullerene** | Cage-like or soccer-ball-shaped molecules made entirely of carbon atoms | buckminsterfullerene, C₆₀ |\n| **Lamp-black (soot)** | Fine black carbon powder collected from the smoky flame of burning oil or hydrocarbon fuels | black printing ink, pigments |",
            "bodyHinglish": "| Shabd | Matlab (simple bhasha mein) | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Tetravalency** | Ek atom ki 4 valency: wo 4 bond bana sakta hai | carbon: CH₄ mein 4 bond |\n| **Catenation** | Ek hi tatva ke atomon ka aapas mein jud kar lambi chain, shakha (branch) ya ring banana | carbon ki chain C–C–C–C |\n| **Organic compound** | Carbon ka wo yaugik jo mukhya roop se carbon aur hydrogen par bana hota hai (aur aksar O, N, Cl, Br ke saath) | cheeni, petrol, sabun |\n| **Inorganic compound** | Baaki yaugik: dhaatu, namak, acid, oxide ityadi | NaCl, H₂SO₄ |\n| **Allotrope (roop)** | Ek hi tatva ke alag-alag shakal wale roop, jinme atom alag tareeke se jude hain | heera aur graphite |\n| **Crystalline** | Atomon ka regular, doharaya jaane wala jaal | heera, graphite |\n| **Amorphous** | Jisme atomon ka koi regular lambi duri tak ka pattern nahi hota | koyla, charcoal |\n| **Fullerene** | Carbon ke gole ya football jaisi shakal wale molecule | C₆₀ |\n| **Lamp-black** | Diya ya tel ki lau ka kaala dhuan (soot) jo ikattha karne par bana kaala carbon ka powder | kaajal, ink |"
