            "explanationHinglish": "Bachke rehna (\"Poora aur adhoora jalna, dono mein ek jaise products banti hain, bas kam ya zyada.\"): Ye galat hai. Demonstration: Example 7 mein 3.2 g methane ko dekho. Poori hawa mein: CO₂ (8.8 g) aur paani. Kam hawa mein: CO (5.6 g) aur paani, aur kuch kaalikh bhi ban sakti hai. CO aur CO₂ alag padarth hain: CO zehreeli, jo khoon ke haemoglobin se chipak kar oxygen ko rokti hai (Class 9); CO₂ nahi (ye zehreeli nahi, par greenhouse gas hai). Rajas ke chulhe ki neeli lau poore jalne ki nishani hai; peeli lau, patile par kaalikh aur kamre mein dam ghutna adhoore jalne ke sanket hain. | Jalna | Lau | Carbon wala product | Zehreeli? | |---|---|---|---| | Poora (kaafi oxygen) | neeli | CO₂ | nahi | | Adhoora (kam oxygen) | peeli | CO aur kaalikh | CO haan | Niyam: products oxygen kitni mili par nirbhar karte hain. Peeli lau dikhe to burner saaf karwao aur kamre mein hawa ka intezaam rakho."
