        "summaryHinglish": "Topic 1 se Topic 8 tak hamne carbon ke ghar ke ek-ek kamre ko andar se dekha: carbon ke chaar haath aur uske allotrope, homologous series, naam aur isomer, alkane, alkene aur alkyne, ethanol, ethanoic acid, aur sabun-detergent.",
