            "bodyHinglish": "Topic 1 se Topic 8 tak hamne carbon ke ghar ke ek-ek kamre ko andar se dekha: carbon ke chaar haath aur uske allotrope, homologous series, naam aur isomer, alkane, alkene aur alkyne, ethanol, ethanoic acid, aur sabun-detergent. Ab sawaal ye hai: kya ye saare kamre ek **ghar** ki tarah juda hua dikhte hain? Aaj hum unke beech ke **raaste** dhoondhenge, mixed sawaal hal karenge, bachi hui galtiyan pakdenge, aur poore chapter ka saar likhenge. Ye Chemistry ka Class 10 ka aakhri chapter hai, to aaj ka din ek chhoti si \"vijay-yatra\" bhi hai."
